              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, bow, thrusting spear and a horse. May have a shield (+1 pt) and javelins (+1 pt). May be Open Order or Skirmishers. Moldavian Calarasi are Expert Horsemen (+2 pts). (Armies of Chivalry p.49)</characteristic>
