              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon. May have shield (+1 pt) and either two-handed weapon (+2 pts) or thrusting spear (+2 pts). Open Order, may count Rank Bonus up to +2 in the Open. Hate Tartars and Akinjis. Available in Moldavian armies only. 1+ unit. (Armies of Chivalry p.49)</characteristic>
